sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Acknowledge durable intake, delete after database completion
accDescr: Queue acceptance precedes the client acknowledgment, and the consumer deletes the message only after idempotent database processing succeeds.
participant A as EC2 application
participant Q as SQS
participant C as Rate-controlled consumer
participant D as On-premises database
A->>Q: Send request with unique ID
Q-->>A: Successful submission
Note over A: Acknowledge queued request to client
C->>Q: Receive request
Q-->>C: Message and receipt handle
C->>D: Apply update idempotently by request ID
D-->>C: Completion confirmed
C->>Q: Delete message
Note over C,D: Retry after failure must not apply the update twice
